  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Archetypometrics, a Pragmateia: Empirical Determination of the Fundamental Archetypes of Fictional Characters (2025) in Zenodo. 3232 downloads.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Archetypometrics, a Pragmateia: Empirical Determination of the Fundamental Archetypes of Fictional Characters (2025) in Zenodo is authored by Dodds, Peter Sheridan, Zimmerman, Julia Witte and Beauregard, Calla G.. Topics: Archetype, Storytelling, Computer science, Quality (philosophy) and Personality.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">1 citations (OpenAlex).</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
